---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout canonical="https://artcenter.com.pl">
  <Header />
  <main><section class="relative not-prose md:-mt-[76px]"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl relative px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="pointer-events-none md:pt-[76px] pt-0"></div><div class="lg:flex lg:gap-8 lg:h-[60vh] lg:items-center lg:py-0 md:py-20 py-12"><div class="mx-auto basis-1/2 lg:text-left md:pb-16 pb-10 text-center"><h1 class="mb-4 font-heading font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter dark:text-gray-200 md:text-6xl text-5xl"><span class="dark:text-white highlight text-accent text-gray-700">ŚLASKI SERWIS FLOTY</span></h1><div class="mx-auto lg:max-w-none max-w-3xl"><p class="text-muted text-xl dark:text-slate-300 mb-6">Wieloletnie doświadczenie we współpracy z klientami flotowymi gwarantuje odpowiednią jakość oraz niestandardowe rozwiązania, które do minimum ograniczają czas potrzebny do wykonania przeglądu lub usunięcia awarii. Specjalne programy flotowe z gwarancją mobilności włącznie.</p><div class="flex flex-col flex-nowrap gap-4 lg:justify-start lg:m-0 lg:max-w-7xl m-auto max-w-xs sm:flex-row sm:justify-center sm:max-w-md"></div></div></div><div class="basis-1/2"><div class="relative m-auto max-w-5xl"><img alt="ArtCenter Workshop Image" class="mx-auto w-full rounded-md" decoding="async" height="700" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 400px, (max-width: 1023px) 768px, (max-width: 2039px) 1024px, 2040px" src="/images/artcenter_9.jpg" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:center;max-width:800px;max-height:700px;aspect-ratio:1.1428571428571428;width:100%" width="800"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative not-prose scroll-mt-[72px]"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none -z-[1]" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-transparent"></div></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl relative px-4 lg:py-20 md:px-6 md:py-16 py-12 text-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-8 p-4"><div class="md:flex md:gap-16 md:flex-row-reverse"><div class="md:basis-1/2 self-center"><div class="space-y-8"><div class="flex"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-600 dark:bg-green-700 h-7 text-gray-50 w-7"><svg class="h-5 w-5" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" data-icon="tabler:check"><symbol id="ai:tabler:check"><path d="m5 12l5 5L20 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"/></symbol><use xlink:href="#ai:tabler:check"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rtl:ml-0 ml-4 rtl:mr-4"><h3 class="dark:text-white font-medium leading-6 text-lg">Cenimy Twój czas</h3><p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400 mt-2">Odpręż się w naszej poczekalni przy kawie lub herbacie. W międzyczasie my zajmiemy się Twoim samochodem.</p></div></div><div class="flex"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-600 dark:bg-green-700 h-7 text-gray-50 w-7"><svg class="h-5 w-5" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" data-icon="tabler:check"><use xlink:href="#ai:tabler:check"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rtl:ml-0 ml-4 rtl:mr-4"><h3 class="dark:text-white font-medium leading-6 text-lg">Ty pracujesz, my naprawiamy</h3><p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400 mt-2">Posiadamy odpowiednie zaplecze do tego abyś mógł w spokoju i wygodnie popracować.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="md:basis-1/2 md:mt-0 mt-10" aria-hidden="true"><div class="relative m-auto max-w-4xl"><img alt="Startup Image" class="mx-auto w-full bg-gray-500 rounded-lg shadow-lg" decoding="async" height="700" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 432px" src="/images/artcenter_5.jpg" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:center;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1.1428571428571428" width="800"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative not-prose scroll-mt-[72px]"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none -z-[1]" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-transparent"></div></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl relative px-4 lg:py-20 md:px-6 md:py-16 py-12 text-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-8 p-4"><div class="md:flex md:gap-16"><div class="md:basis-1/2 self-center"><div class="space-y-8"><div class="flex"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-600 dark:bg-green-700 h-7 text-gray-50 w-7"><svg class="h-5 w-5" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" data-icon="tabler:check"><use xlink:href="#ai:tabler:check"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rtl:ml-0 ml-4 rtl:mr-4"><h3 class="dark:text-white font-medium leading-6 text-lg">Dostęp do sali konferencyjnej</h3></div></div><div class="flex"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-600 dark:bg-green-700 h-7 text-gray-50 w-7"><svg class="h-5 w-5" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" data-icon="tabler:check"><use xlink:href="#ai:tabler:check"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rtl:ml-0 ml-4 rtl:mr-4"><h3 class="dark:text-white font-medium leading-6 text-lg">Możliwość organizacji spotkań biznesowych</h3></div></div><div class="flex"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-600 dark:bg-green-700 h-7 text-gray-50 w-7"><svg class="h-5 w-5" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" data-icon="tabler:check"><use xlink:href="#ai:tabler:check"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rtl:ml-0 ml-4 rtl:mr-4"><h3 class="dark:text-white font-medium leading-6 text-lg">Dostęp do internetu</h3></div></div><div class="flex"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-600 dark:bg-green-700 h-7 text-gray-50 w-7"><svg class="h-5 w-5" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" data-icon="tabler:check"><use xlink:href="#ai:tabler:check"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rtl:ml-0 ml-4 rtl:mr-4"><h3 class="dark:text-white font-medium leading-6 text-lg">Cisza i spokój – z dala od zgiełku warsztatu</h3></div></div></div></div><div class="md:basis-1/2 md:mt-0 mt-10" aria-hidden="true"><div class="relative m-auto max-w-4xl"><img alt="ArtCenter Conference Room Image" class="mx-auto w-full bg-gray-500 rounded-lg shadow-lg" decoding="async" height="700" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 432px" src="/images/328.jpg" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:center;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1.1428571428571428" width="800"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative not-prose scroll-mt-[72px]"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none -z-[1]" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-transparent"></div></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl relative px-4 lg:py-20 md:px-6 md:py-16 py-12 text-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-8 p-4"><div class="md:flex md:gap-16 md:flex-row-reverse"><div class="md:basis-1/2 self-center"><div class="space-y-8"><div class="flex"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-600 dark:bg-green-700 h-7 text-gray-50 w-7"><svg class="h-5 w-5" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" data-icon="tabler:check"><use xlink:href="#ai:tabler:check"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rtl:ml-0 ml-4 rtl:mr-4"><h3 class="dark:text-white font-medium leading-6 text-lg">Zarezerwuj samochód zastępczy</h3></div></div><div class="flex"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-600 dark:bg-green-700 h-7 text-gray-50 w-7"><svg class="h-5 w-5" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" data-icon="tabler:check"><use xlink:href="#ai:tabler:check"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rtl:ml-0 ml-4 rtl:mr-4"><h3 class="dark:text-white font-medium leading-6 text-lg">Skorzystaj z usługi odbioru pojazdu</h3></div></div><div class="flex"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-600 dark:bg-green-700 h-7 text-gray-50 w-7"><svg class="h-5 w-5" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" data-icon="tabler:check"><use xlink:href="#ai:tabler:check"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rtl:ml-0 ml-4 rtl:mr-4"><h3 class="dark:text-white font-medium leading-6 text-lg">Odkryj miasto na dwóch kołach - wypożycz rower</h3></div></div><div class="flex"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-600 dark:bg-green-700 h-7 text-gray-50 w-7"><svg class="h-5 w-5" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" data-icon="tabler:check"><use xlink:href="#ai:tabler:check"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rtl:ml-0 ml-4 rtl:mr-4"><h3 class="dark:text-white font-medium leading-6 text-lg">A może eko? Przygotowaliśmy dla Ciebie hulajnogę elektryczną</h3></div></div></div></div><div class="md:basis-1/2 md:mt-0 mt-10" aria-hidden="true"><div class="relative m-auto max-w-4xl"><img alt="ArtCenter Front Workshop Image" class="mx-auto w-full bg-gray-500 rounded-lg shadow-lg" decoding="async" height="700" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 432px" src="/images/artcenter_2.jpg" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:center;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1.1428571428571428" width="800"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative not-prose scroll-mt-[72px]" id="contact"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none -z-[1]" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute inset-0"></div></div><div class="mx-auto relative px-4 lg:py-20 md:px-6 md:py-16 py-12 text-default max-w-6xl"><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:gap-12"><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 gap-8 lg:mr-16 md:gap-12 md:mr-8 mr-0"><div class="mb-4 md:mb-8 md:mx-auto md:text-left rtl:md:text-right text-center"><h2 class="mb-4 font-heading font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter lg:text-4xl text-3xl text-heading">Skontaktuj się z nami</h2><p class="text-muted dark:text-slate-400 mb-8 mt-4 text-xl">Masz pytania? Wybierz jedną z form kontaktu lub odwiedź nas w naszym biurze.</p></div><div class="w-full md:text-left rtl:md:text-right text-center"></div></div><div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 px-0"><ul class="space-y-10"><li class="flex md:-mx-4"><div class="pr-4 rtl:pl-4 rtl:pr-0 rtl:sm:pl-0 rtl:sm:pr-4 sm:pl-4"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-100 font-bold h-16 mx-auto text-2xl text-primary w-16"><svg class="h-6 w-6 icon-bold" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" data-icon="tabler:mail"><symbol id="ai:tabler:mail"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7z"/><path d="m3 7l9 6l9-6"/></g></symbol><use xlink:href="#ai:tabler:mail"></use></svg></span></div><div class="pl-4 rtl:pl-0 rtl:pr-4"><h3 class="mb-4 font-heading font-semibold text-xl">Napisz emaila</h3><p class="text-muted dark:text-gray-400">biuro@artcenter.com.pl</p></div></li><li class="flex md:-mx-4"><div class="pr-4 rtl:pl-4 rtl:pr-0 rtl:sm:pl-0 rtl:sm:pr-4 sm:pl-4"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-100 font-bold h-16 mx-auto text-2xl text-primary w-16"><svg class="h-6 w-6 icon-bold" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" data-icon="tabler:headset"><symbol id="ai:tabler:headset"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 14v-3a8 8 0 1 1 16 0v3m-2 5c0 1.657-2.686 3-6 3"/><path d="M4 14a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h1a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3zm11 0a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h1a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3z"/></g></symbol><use xlink:href="#ai:tabler:headset"></use></svg></span></div><div class="pl-4 rtl:pl-0 rtl:pr-4"><h3 class="mb-4 font-heading font-semibold text-xl">Zadzwoń do nas</h3><p class="text-muted dark:text-gray-400">+48 508 353 720 lub +48 790 504 064</p></div></li><li class="flex md:-mx-4"><div class="pr-4 rtl:pl-4 rtl:pr-0 rtl:sm:pl-0 rtl:sm:pr-4 sm:pl-4"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-100 font-bold h-16 mx-auto text-2xl text-primary w-16"><svg class="h-6 w-6 icon-bold" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" data-icon="tabler:map-pin"><symbol id="ai:tabler:map-pin"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 11a3 3 0 1 0 6 0a3 3 0 0 0-6 0"/><path d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a2 2 0 0 1-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1 1 11.314 0z"/></g></symbol><use xlink:href="#ai:tabler:map-pin"></use></svg></span></div><div class="pl-4 rtl:pl-0 rtl:pr-4"><h3 class="mb-4 font-heading font-semibold text-xl">Nasze biuro</h3><p class="text-muted dark:text-gray-400">ul. Borki 1A, 40-348 Katowice</p></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section></main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
